    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe intsaahhasadá' sleémeero ar iimu/uuma daanduú Kristowo masók an alií geexawaán, nee tari geerií kumiitaán baraá intsaahhasadá' hee gu kwa/as baraá slafíngw qeeruuwo. Atén a sla'aanaaká intsaahhasadár iimu/uuma kawa malé inki/aan, tidá' hee iwa hhu'u'un nee tlehhma'aá slafa'aaká ngiwa may, nee Mungú nguwa haratlintii'i; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee intsaahhasár daanduú baatiísmo nee ar dákwií qaasa; nee i intsaahhasár daanduú waasle/ nee sakwasleemár alhhe'eesay wasl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala ta tihe, atén gár tiwa hariím an geerií kumitaán. Adoorí an tleehhaán, bar Mungú ngaa slaá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma múk aa qaroó alií kii/, adór kungur ki/isi baraá hhu'u'úngw i alé a adoomá? Asma inooín kingina dahaás baraá gwa/aateemaá Mungú, tsuuqaá Mungú kudá' gawaá dooraá dahhá' kiri tsaáq, Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú kuri én, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "axweesantá Mungú kari tsaáq adór kar hhoó', nee /uuruú yaamuudá' xaawá' kuri tsaáq. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo baraá haratlintaaor'ine tari alií kií/. I ya/aandaaká múk adoosíng kuwa ki/isi baraá hhu'u'úngw i alé, asma inooín Garmoó Mungú ku malé kiki'ín gawaá msalaába ar fahhari, nee ku geeraá múk wa mureekeemiis.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamaá ta du'umiís nee tluwaay daqtá yaariire, nee bu'úngw hhó' nguri laqwaaliyé', oo slaasláwár huwahuúw dír dooslusmoowo, yaamaá adoorí tsuuqaá Mungú ngi slayá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala yaamuudá' gár naa laqwaliyé' bar laqaya' nee fuquráy, gár i buiya' i káhh. Yaamaá adoorí kaa nak/aás lu'usaro nee Mungú. Alhhe'eesaywo ki daa/ ar asla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala atén tam adoorí kaahana, sla'aaruuser'eé', atén daandeemoohunge harahhifo a koomaán asma kuungá' tsuuqaá ba/ama iga sleeré'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Mungú i ganaa'. Slám gadiyérhúng tidá' taa tlehhé' ga gunqareesiiká, nee sla'aarirhúng tidá' taa dirós i geehhooesé' ar loohír múk hhohhó' oo Mungú kuwa sagadiyusé' nee slám tam hamí a kumitá' kuwa sagadiyusa'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár atén ta ló'wa sla'aan masók umuúqo heewo dirhunge ilakaaharuudá' gun ar kumiit ar inkihhimu ay alhhe'eesaay, as muruudá' ta harahhifa' kuwa sleera'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén a sla'aanaaká kuungá' tawa tli/uuse, ala kuungá' masók a adór mukdá' aa haratlintii', kudá' qiqtliím, as kahhó' muruudá' aa al'axweés kuwa ala'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Mungú al'axweesani ngiwa oó' dír Abrahamu, lo'o gari /aáy adór tidá' aa oó' ir tleehharút. Lo'oodá' gari /aay ar umuuwós inósuú kilá', asma oo úr oo inós gu baá/ i kaahh, oo lo'o ngir huwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina oó', «Ar ló', án kuúng u tsuúq, nee u xwaylár yaariír i haniís.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe Abrahamu iri qiqtlín, nee gadaádá' Mungú aa al'axweés, gari sláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hee barnaxes lo'o ga huuw, lo'oodá' gan huuw ar umuú kudá' úr oo inós gu baá/. Gawaá adoorihe kaangaani sleémeero dír muko gár ga tsaat a lo'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe Mungú sleeme lo'o gana /aáy qoomár al'axweesantós ngiwa gawdeesár wa slaá' dír mukdá' al'axweesnatadá' ga aál, adór inós ir baloó warqayká baraá tidá' aa al'axweesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe Mungú muruuwí tsár gwa oó', al'axweesantós nee lo'o. Muruuwí i baloó warqayká, nee Mungú lama ga baloó ooiiká daanduú muruuwihe. Ateéká' inós ugwa i guwaan, muruuwí atén tin ló'wa gurkwa/amis, as harahhifoodá' taa geeraarén i qaás kawa slawaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Harahhifoorí a toorén. Haraxu'utirí muneerén gaa ló'wa ót as miwa qwát. Adoodá' miringamo kur baraá ma'áy ila/aa/an ar tlaa/a, as mukuwa tliw/ín nee gwaanduú ma'aay. Harahhifoorén tí alhhe'eesaywós dír kway tseék a gawaá doori, dír ira waaráhh a dír baquú baraá doó Mungú i dirií'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu ina dáh baraadí alé tawa heé giiriím dír atene, nee tawa saayusmoorén. Asma inós an kaahamusmoorén ar adoodár Melkisedeki ay alhhe'eesay wasle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
